      "date": "2003-07-21",
      "orig": "      Code Points for FC Frame with FARP-REQ Command for MATCH_WW_PN_NN\n +---+----------------+----------------+----------------+------------+\n |Wrd|    <31:24>     |    <23:16>     |    <15:08>     |    <07:00> |\n +---+----------------+----------------+----------------+------------+\n | 0 |    0x04        |                     D_ID =                   |\n |   |                |    0xFF             0xFF              0xFF   |\n +---+----------------+----------------+----------------+------------+\n | 1 |    0x00        |                     S_ID                     |\n +---+----------------+----------------+----------------+------------+\n | 2 |    0x05        |                     F_CTL                    |\n +---+----------------+----------------+----------------+------------+\n | 3 |   SEQ_ID       |     0x20       |          SEQ_CNT            |\n +---+----------------+----------------+----------------+------------+",
      "correct": "      Code Points for FC Frame with FARP-REQ Command for MATCH_WW_PN_NN\n +---+----------------+----------------+----------------+------------+\n |Wrd|    <31:24>     |    <23:16>     |    <15:08>     |    <07:00> |\n +---+----------------+----------------+----------------+------------+\n | 0 |    0x22        |                     D_ID =                   |\n |   |                |    0xFF             0xFF              0xFF   |\n +---+----------------+----------------+----------------+------------+\n | 1 |    0x00        |                     S_ID                     |\n +---+----------------+----------------+----------------+------------+\n | 2 |    0x01        |                     F_CTL                    |\n +---+----------------+----------------+----------------+------------+\n | 3 |   SEQ_ID       |     0x00       |          SEQ_CNT            |\n +---+----------------+----------------+----------------+------------+",
      "notes": "This embodies three changes:\n- R_CTL (word 0, bits 31:24) should be 0x22, not 0x04\n- TYPE (word 2, bits 31:24) should be 0x01, not 0x05\n- DF_CTL (word 3, bits 23:16) should be 0x00, not 0x20"
    },
